  o Minor features (denial of service mitigation):
    - Directory caches can now rate limit BEGIN_DIR cells per circuit,
      independently of the exit stream creation limit. This is controlled
      by the new DoSBeginDirRateEnabled, DoSBeginDirRate, DoSBeginDirBurst
      and DoSBeginDirDefenseType consensus parameters and torrc options,
      enabled by default. Refusals are reported in the heartbeat and in the
      relay_dos_total{type="begindir_rate_rejected"} metric. Part of
      ticket 41411.
